window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"singed","b":"masteryi","win":["Singed","Singed","Skill","Master Yi","Master Yi","Master Yi","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Level 1","text":"You proxy and poison him before his damage exists — take the map for free."},{"when":"Yi levels 4-5","text":"Wuju Style adds true damage — armour does not answer his DPS at all."},{"when":"Yi level 6","text":"Highlander (85s) is slow-immune — but the Fling-into-goo root is not a slow."},{"when":"Yi first item","text":"His shred melts you faster than poison hurts him; never 1v1 from here out."}],"wants":{"you":["Early tempo stolen with proxy waves","Cross-map trades while he chases you","Teamfights where your team eats him"],"foe":["Clean farm into his item spikes","Isolated duels anywhere after 6","You caught split with no escape route"]},"early":"Take the first two levels for everything they hold: proxy and poison him before his damage exists, and let Poison Trail plus the Fling threat out-pressure his item-less kit. By 3 Alpha Strike goes untargetable through your Fling — but it is 20s at rank 1 and Mega Adhesive grounds it, so drop the goo first.","mid":"From 4-5 his DPS clearly out-damages your weak early poison, and at 6 Highlander lets him stick straight through your slows. Do not test it. Proxy for cross-map tempo, trade towers instead of trades, and make him choose between chasing an unkillable clown and letting his map burn.","late":"From his first item on he out-duels and out-splits you — Wuju Style is true damage, so armour buys you nothing. Never be alone: split only with escape routes and teleport, Fling him into your team when he dives, and use that same Fling to cancel Meditate, which is a channel and breaks outright.","whys":["You proxy and poison him at level 1 before his damage even exists.","At 2 your Poison Trail and Fling still out-pressure his item-less kit.","Alpha Strike is untargetable but 20s at rank 1 — Fling him inside that gap.","By 4-5 his DPS clearly out-damages your weak early poison — his window opens.","Highlander, 85s, ignores slows — only the Fling-into-Mega-Adhesive root holds him.","Wuju Style's true damage means armour buys nothing — his shred melts you anyway.","At 2+ items he fully out-duels and out-splits your poison-tank kit — group and kite him into your team."]});
